        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All applicants for employment who have three and one-half (3%) or more year's experience in the trade, are residents of the geographical area constituting the normal construction labor market, have passed a Journeyman Lineman's examination given by a duly constituted Outside Local Union of the IBEW or have been certified as a Journeyman Lineman by any Outside Area Joint Apprenticeship and Training Committee and who have been employed in the trade for a period of at least one (1) year in the last three and one-half (3%) years in the geographical area covered by the collective bargaining agreement.",
